# The following remain eligible for Git tracking:
# ml/artifacts/model_metadata.json
# ml/artifacts/test_evaluation_report.json
#
# The documentation image docs/assets/confusion_matrix.png
# remains eligible for Git tracking.
#
# Avoid tracking the duplicate generated image:
/ml/artifacts/confusion_matrix.png

